{"description": "Square white plate roughly 22-24 cm across with food arranged in the center-right area; image is rotated so plate appears sideways. Leafy greens (spinach-like, dark green, wilted, glossy with some moisture) covering the top portion of the plate, about 12% of plate area, flat-ish layer about 1 cm thick.", "candidates": ["sautéed spinach", "wilted kale", "mixed salad greens with dressing"], "grams": 45},
{"description": "Penne-shaped pasta pieces, pale yellow with slight sheen, scattered across the plate in several tubes, some glossy with oil or sauce, covering about 10% of the plate, low height.", "candidates": ["penne pasta", "rigatoni", "pasta with butter or oil"], "grams": 70},
{"description": "Creamy white sauce or cheese-based topping on chunks, matte-to-glossy off-white with browned edges in places, covering about 12% of plate, moderate thickness.", "candidates": ["cream sauce or alfredo", "ricotta or cheese topping", "mayonnaise-based dressing"], "grams": 50},
{"description": "Pieces of roasted or sautéed vegetables with golden-brown browning and irregular cut shapes, including mushroom-like dark pieces and yellow chunks, about 8% of plate, small chunky pieces.", "candidates": ["roasted mushrooms", "roasted potatoes", "sautéed zucchini"], "grams": 40},
{"description": "Sliced cooked meat, pinkish-brown interior with browned surface, slightly moist, one or two slices covering about 6% of plate, medium thickness.", "candidates": ["roast pork", "roast beef", "turkey breast"], "grams": 35},
{"description": "Crumbly brown granular topping, dry and textured, scattered over several spots, likely a breadcrumb or nut-based crust, about 6% of plate, thin layer.", "candidates": ["breadcrumb topping", "toasted nut crumble", "crumbled sausage or meat crumbs"], "grams": 20}
]}
